WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Jing-Zhang Proof Gardens: a public verification institution before a tech image.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One public experiment spine connects three proof gardens.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A complete land-use partition covers the temporary design boundary.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Zhongzhiyuan validates technology, Origin shares learning, and Dazhongsi tests adoption and repair.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Mobility and blue-green systems begin with continuity, accessibility, and human takeover.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Statutory intensity and demolition remain unknown until official data arrives.
